# --- Vendored harness (XYZ + PDDA) ---------------------------------------
# .xyz/ and utils/pdda/ are vendored deliberately and are TRACKED, not ignored,
# so the harness travels with the repo. Two notes:
#
# 1. The xyz vendor installer appends `.xyz/` here by default. Do not restore
#    that line — it would untrack the harness. (It previously fused with the
#    `*.cact` rule above, because this file had no trailing newline, silently
#    disabling `*.cact`. Keep a trailing newline.)
# 2. This file's Python packaging patterns collide with real harness source.
#    `lib/` (line 12) swallows .xyz/test/lib/*.sh, so re-include it explicitly.
!.xyz/test/lib/
!.xyz/test/lib/**

# Machine-local / generated state that stays ignored inside the vendored trees:
.xyz/**/__pycache__/
/.tick/
PROJECT/PDDA-ACTIVITY.jsonl
.pdda-gh-state.tsv

# Consult/relay harness output (.xyz/relay-automation) — generated advisor transcripts, not source.
relay-system/
